      "title": "Analog Cognition and Consciousness",
      "gist": "Cognition and consciousness arise when large-scale brain waves organize and compute over neuron spiking, not synapses alone.",
      "question": "Brain waves — how do they, rather than synapses alone, give rise to flexible cognition and consciousness? (a unifying framework)",
      "sourceHeading": "Analog Cognition and Consciousness"
