        "spya-d238cn"
      ],
      "title": "Abstract",
      "gist": "The abstract claims cognition and consciousness emerge from two-way interaction between spiking and brain-wide waves, which act as an executive controller organizing neurons into flexible patterns.",
      "sourceHeading": "Abstract"
    },
