      "title": "Introduction",
      "gist": "Cognition depends on top-down feedback systems that filter sensory input, control actions, and retrieve memories, requiring a control system able to coordinate hundreds of millions of neurons within fractions of a second.",
      "sourceHeading": "Introduction"
