      "title": "Limits of Synaptic-Only Models",
      "gist": "Traditional spike-and-synapse models cannot plausibly implement fast top-down control, since that would require instantly tracking which neurons to coordinate; brain-wave oscillations offer a simpler, biologically plausible alternative."
    },
