      "title": "Traveling Waves and Representational Change",
      "gist": "Brain waves frequently travel across the cortical surface, and alpha/beta traveling waves in particular may drive shifts between different states of neural representation.",
      "question": "Traveling waves — how might wave movement across cortex produce shifts in what neural populations represent? (a proposed mechanism)",
      "sourceHeading": "Traveling Waves and Representational Change"
    },
