      "title": "Consciousness and Synthesis",
      "gist": "Disrupted wave coordination under anesthesia, comparison with rival theories, and a synthesis argument together support consciousness as an emergent property of organized, brain-wide wave dynamics.",
      "question": "Consciousness — how does organized, brain-wide wave activity, rather than isolated circuits, give rise to a unified conscious state? (anesthesia evidence and theory comparison)"
    },
