      ],
      "title": "Altered Cortical Waves and Unconsciousness",
      "gist": "Different anesthetics act on different molecular targets yet all converge on the same outcome, slow desynchronized cortical waves, suggesting consciousness depends on large-scale wave organization rather than specific receptors.",
      "sourceHeading": "Altered Cortical Waves and Unconsciousness"
    },
